== Rescinding of contract  [Sec. 52] <52>

When partnership is rescinded #footnote[rescinded means to make void *OR* to cut off] due to fraud or misrepresentation, the defrauded party gets three rights:


#table(
  columns: 3,
  align: (center, left, left),
  inset: 10pt,
  table.header(
    [], [*Right*], [*Description*],
  ),
[1],
[ Lien on/right of retention of Surplus],
[Retain amount paid for share(same as premium paid when joining) + capital contribution from remaining assets after debts],

[2],
[Creditor Status],
[in respect of any payment made by him towards the debts of the firm],

[3],
[Indemnity],
[Fraudulent partner(s) must indemnify against ALL firm debts]

)
